# tools/cp/kglitch/fpsprobe-stack.p9 -- H4-kglitch (docs/cp-kglitch.md §2): tools/cp/p9/fpsprobe.p9
# with the world profile taking kernel stack words (who halts in safe_wfi), 60 s.
# tools/cp/p9/fpsprobe.p9 -- a frame-rate experiment boot (lane C9-play, docs/cp-p9.md §5):
# play.p9's load sequence, 3 minutes of walking, a guest PC profile, then stop.
# (play.p9's header follows.)
# Main menu -> LOAD GAME -> ManualSave-86 (the user's save, "The Ripperdoc",
# Megabuilding H10 atrium, Little China, Watson), ~10.5 min of play with QMP
# keyboard + relative mouse (walk, turn, sprint, map), F5 quick save, QUIT GAME.
# The sequences come from the interactive boot ctl1 (docs/cp-p9.md §2):
#  * menus: the focus is hidden until the first key; taps need ~0.8 s
#    spacing (boot_p9 `key` default); `seek` reads the highlighted row's
#    position from the screendump, so no tap count is trusted (gateA1: in the
#    main menu "up" past CONTINUE lands on the patch-notes button).
#  * LOAD GAME groups saves by playthrough; "0" expands every group; the
#    Ripperdoc group (ManualSave-86) is the last entry, above the
#    Cross Progression button.
#  * the save's world: walking forward from the start meets Jackie (a talk
#    trigger, not a choice); the street is behind and to the left.

phase menu
shot menu
# ---- LOAD GAME -> ManualSave-86 ---------------------------------------------
seek menu-load main down 6 LOAD GAME
key ret
expect loadlist 30 LOAD\s*GAME|Expand\s*groups|Coll\w*\s*groups|Progression
key 0
wait 2
# the list with both groups expanded (ctl1): Streetkid/AutoSave-16 group at
# the top, then the second Streetkid group whose one entry, "The Ripperdoc"
# (ManualSave-86), has its frame centred at screen row 509
expect loadlist-ripperdoc 10 Ripperdoc
listseek loadlist-focus down 8 509
phase loading
key ret
expect loaded 400 PRESS\b.{0,24}\bTO\s+CONTINUE
key spc
wait 6
phase world
expect inworld 60 RIPPERDOC|Jackie
shot world-start

# ---- 3 minutes of walking, then stop (no save) -------------------------------
hold w 3000
look 1200 0 40 16
repeat 6
down shift
hold w 6000
up shift
look 350 0 15 16
hold w 4000
look -300 0 10 16
wait 3
shot fp-loop
end
prof 60 10 fp-world stack
stop
